{"id":"50ca9db6cf8f4a12","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-myhill-isomorphism.md","title":"Myhill 同构定理","display":"thm-myhill-isomorphism — Myhill 同构定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism","aliases":["20-thm-myhill-isomorphism"],"display":"thm-myhill-isomorphism — Myhill 同构定理","chapter":"1","section":"1.7.1","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 1.7.4","source_pdf_pages":[56],"source_printed_pages":[20],"depends_on":["[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]","[[20-df-one-reduction]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-myhill-isomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-myhill-isomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-myhill-isomorphism — Myhill 同构定理"},{"key":"chapter","html":"1"},{"key":"section","html":"1.7.1"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 1.7.4"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2d6dc64668d77215\" href=\"?note=2d6dc64668d77215\" title=\"20-df-computable-isomorphism\">20-df-computable-isomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_1\">\\(\\equiv_1\\)</span> 为双向一一归约，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_c\">\\(\\cong_c\\)</span> 为可计算置换同构。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"2d6dc64668d77215\" href=\"?note=2d6dc64668d77215\" title=\"20-df-computable-isomorphism\">20-df-computable-isomorphism</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f15de2c66c6318e\" href=\"?note=1f15de2c66c6318e\" title=\"20-df-one-reduction\">20-df-one-reduction</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_1B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\cong_cB.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_1B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\cong_cB.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>若有计算置换 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span>，其逆在输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 上搜索唯一满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x)=y\">\\(p(x)=y\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，普通可计算；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,p^{-1}\">\\(p,p^{-1}\\)</span> 给两方向一一归约。</p>\n<p>反向取全可计算单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,g\">\\(f,g\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in A\\iff f(x)\\in B\">\\(x\\in A\\iff f(x)\\in B\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\\in B\\iff g(y)\\in A\">\\(y\\in B\\iff g(y)\\in A\\)</span>。构造递增有限部分双射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_s\">\\(p_s\\)</span>，已配对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x,y\">\\(x,y\\)</span> 总保持同一成员真值。偶数步处理最小未配对输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span>：计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x_0)\">\\(f(x_0)\\)</span>；若该值已在当前值域，沿有限匹配的逆走到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_1=p_s^{-1}(f(x_0))\">\\(x_1=p_s^{-1}(f(x_0))\\)</span>，再算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x_1)\">\\(f(x_1)\\)</span>，如此继续，直到值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 未用过，直接加一对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x_0,y)\">\\((x_0,y)\\)</span>，保留所有旧配对。</p>\n<p>此搜索必停止。若它始终留在大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 的旧值域，单射 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> 与有限双射逆使访问的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 不重复：任一重复都能向前追溯到未在旧定义域的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span>，矛盾。故至多经过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 个旧配对就离开。沿路每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_i\">\\(x_i\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f(x_i)\">\\(f(x_i)\\)</span> 及下一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_{i+1}\">\\(x_{i+1}\\)</span> 保持同一成员真值，因此最终 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x_0\">\\(x_0\\)</span> 真值相同，无须判定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\">\\(A,B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>奇数步对最小未配对输出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y_0\">\\(y_0\\)</span> 使用 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g\">\\(g\\)</span> 及有限匹配 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_s\">\\(p_s\\)</span> 作对称搜索，找到未用输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 并加 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(x,y_0)\">\\((x,y_0)\\)</span>。两种搜索都有限且可计算，旧配对从不更改，每个自然数最终进入定义域及值域。给输入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>，模拟到它被配对即算出最终 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p(x)\">\\(p(x)\\)</span>，因此极限是全可计算置换，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p[A]=B\">\\(p[A]=B\\)</span>。这补明“交替有限延伸”的终止理由，而非使用一个可能不有效的集合分解版 Cantor–Bernstein 公式。</p>\n<p>来源：印刷 20 / PDF 56。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-one-reduction]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-computable-isomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"2d6dc64668d77215","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-one-reduction","status":"resolved","id":"1f15de2c66c6318e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-computable-isomorphism]]；see [[20-df-one-reduction]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A,B\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\equiv_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong_c","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}myhill\\text{-}isomorphism}\\vdash\nA\\equiv_1B\\Longleftrightarrow A\\cong_cB.","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"p(x)=y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"p,p^{-1}","display":false},{"tex":"f,g","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in A\\iff f(x)\\in B","display":false},{"tex":"y\\in B\\iff g(y)\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"p_s","display":false},{"tex":"x,y","display":false},{"tex":"x_0","display":false},{"tex":"f(x_0)","display":false},{"tex":"x_1=p_s^{-1}(f(x_0))","display":false},{"tex":"f(x_1)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"(x_0,y)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"f","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"x_0","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"x_i","display":false},{"tex":"f(x_i)","display":false},{"tex":"x_{i+1}","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"x_0","display":false},{"tex":"A,B","display":false},{"tex":"y_0","display":false},{"tex":"g","display":false},{"tex":"p_s","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"(x,y_0)","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"p(x)","display":false},{"tex":"p[A]=B","display":false}],"bytes":2365,"backlinks":[{"id":"17f36cae84cb8ff3","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-creative]]；see [[20-df-mcomplete]]；see [[20-thm-productive-characterization]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"4033dacb4f25ad78","anchor":"ref-14","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-K]]；see [[20-df-halt]]；see [[20-df-k1-con]]；see [[20-thm-K-one-complete]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"0d590602754bbccc","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-inf]]；see [[20-df-totex]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]；see [[20-lem-padding]]；see [[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]。"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]] — 章 1；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-19","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-myhill-isomorphism]]"}],"outgoing":["2d6dc64668d77215","1f15de2c66c6318e"]}